    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey into the future of AI-powered conversations with our innovative 3D chatbot experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important:</strong> We offer a demo version of Replikant Chat. Each month, we provide credits for a brief experience, allowing you to explore the app before deciding on a subscription.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subscription is necessary, as Replikant relies on external AI services like ChatGPT and ElevenLabs. This cost primarily covers those services rather than being a charge from us. AI service prices are decreasing, so this will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam labels our app\u2019s download button as &quot;Free to Play,&quot; though we prefer &quot;Demo&quot; to better reflect the experience. The official category for Replikant Chat is &quot;Simulation,&quot; not &quot;Free to Play.&quot; Thank you for your understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash the possibilities:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User-Friendly Interface: our extraordinary 3D characters, navigating them with ease through an interface as familiar as your favorite streaming service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect in real-time with one or more characters, each uniquely crafted with rich personalities, expressive voices, and captivating animations that bring them to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Content: a vast array of topics, from education and entertainment to quizzes, relationships, comedy, and storytelling\u2014each conversation a new adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Environments: yourself in highly realistic 3D environments, where cinematic camera angles make every interaction feel like a scene from your favorite movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the magic as real and AI-generated images seamlessly blend within these dynamic 3D stages, enhancing every narrative and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Interaction: like never before\u2014our characters see you through your webcam and respond to your world in real-time, creating a deeply personal and interactive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multimedia Integration: your world with them\u2014whether it\u2019s documents or images, our characters are ready to access, display, and discuss anything you bring to the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay inspired with regular updates and new characters, ensuring that your journey with us is always fresh, exciting, and full of surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our platform doesn't just offer conversations; it creates immersive, interactive experiences that push the boundaries of AI technology. Whether you're seeking knowledge, entertainment, or a unique way to explore ideas, our 3D chatbot experience opens up a world of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this journey where technology meets imagination, and every interaction is an opportunity to learn, be entertained, and explore the vast potential of AI-driven communication.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey into the future of AI-powered conversations with our innovative 3D chatbot experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important:</strong> We offer a demo version of Replikant Chat. Each month, we provide credits for a brief experience, allowing you to explore the app before deciding on a subscription.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A subscription is necessary, as Replikant relies on external AI services like ChatGPT and ElevenLabs. This cost primarily covers those services rather than being a charge from us. AI service prices are decreasing, so this will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam labels our app\u2019s download button as &quot;Free to Play,&quot; though we prefer &quot;Demo&quot; to better reflect the experience. The official category for Replikant Chat is &quot;Simulation,&quot; not &quot;Free to Play.&quot; Thank you for your understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/4df7cd1bd19d800595eaf14bcbf00dff.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash the possibilities:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User-Friendly Interface: our extraordinary 3D characters, navigating them with ease through an interface as familiar as your favorite streaming service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect in real-time with one or more characters, each uniquely crafted with rich personalities, expressive voices, and captivating animations that bring them to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/cdac91969d3c32802f6338f6482eaaa4.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Content: a vast array of topics, from education and entertainment to quizzes, relationships, comedy, and storytelling\u2014each conversation a new adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Environments: yourself in highly realistic 3D environments, where cinematic camera angles make every interaction feel like a scene from your favorite movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.poster.avif?t=1734517860\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.webm?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093690/extras/6294e8e999d8f4c2fb9793434b2cbb2d.mp4?t=1734517860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness the magic as real and AI-generated images seamlessly blend within these dynamic 3D stages, enhancing every narrative and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Interaction: like never before\u2014our characters see you through your webcam and respond to your world in real-time, creating a deeply personal and interactive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multimedia Integration: your world with them\u2014whether it\u2019s documents or images, our characters are ready to access, display, and discuss anything you bring to the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay inspired with regular updates and new characters, ensuring that your journey with us is always fresh, exciting, and full of surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our platform doesn't just offer conversations; it creates immersive, interactive experiences that push the boundaries of AI technology. Whether you're seeking knowledge, entertainment, or a unique way to explore ideas, our 3D chatbot experience opens up a world of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this journey where technology meets imagination, and every interaction is an opportunity to learn, be entertained, and explore the vast potential of AI-driven communication.</p>",
    "short_description": "Engage with unique AI characters, each with distinct personalities, in immersive 3D environments. Currently in Early Access, a subscription is required for the full experience. Discover a growing roster of educational, entertaining, gaming, narrative, and creative interactions.",
